    "detailed_description": "RogueOut is a unique twist on the classic Breakout-style game, introducing roguelike elements for a fresh and exciting experience. You start by selecting from a variety of powerful balls, each with distinct abilities, and your goal is to clear a field of diverse bricks by strategically launching your ball into them.<br><br>RogueOut introduces an array of distinct Brick Types, adding layers of complexity and excitement. For instance:<br><br>    Armored Bricks: These formidable bricks are clad in layers of armor. Your task is to strategically chip away at this armor until you expose the brick, which you can then destroy.<br><br>    Immunizer Bricks: These crafty bricks confer immunity on two random bricks within the field. Your objective is to annihilate the Immunizer Brick first before you can dismantle the shielded bricks.<br><br>    Healer Bricks: These elusive bricks periodically heal random bricks within the game field. You'll need to target and destroy the Healer Brick swiftly to prevent the restoration of other bricks.&quot;<br><br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463170/extras/562b1f673aa332152bfe2e610ac2ead9.poster.avif?t=1686762496\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463170/extras/562b1f673aa332152bfe2e610ac2ead9.webm?t=1686762496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463170/extras/562b1f673aa332152bfe2e610ac2ead9.mp4?t=1686762496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.",
    "about_the_game": "RogueOut is a unique twist on the classic Breakout-style game, introducing roguelike elements for a fresh and exciting experience. You start by selecting from a variety of powerful balls, each with distinct abilities, and your goal is to clear a field of diverse bricks by strategically launching your ball into them.<br><br>RogueOut introduces an array of distinct Brick Types, adding layers of complexity and excitement. For instance:<br><br>    Armored Bricks: These formidable bricks are clad in layers of armor. Your task is to strategically chip away at this armor until you expose the brick, which you can then destroy.<br><br>    Immunizer Bricks: These crafty bricks confer immunity on two random bricks within the field. Your objective is to annihilate the Immunizer Brick first before you can dismantle the shielded bricks.<br><br>    Healer Bricks: These elusive bricks periodically heal random bricks within the game field. You'll need to target and destroy the Healer Brick swiftly to prevent the restoration of other bricks.&quot;<br><br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463170/extras/562b1f673aa332152bfe2e610ac2ead9.poster.avif?t=1686762496\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463170/extras/562b1f673aa332152bfe2e610ac2ead9.webm?t=1686762496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463170/extras/562b1f673aa332152bfe2e610ac2ead9.mp4?t=1686762496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.",
    "short_description": "RogueOut is a fresh take on Breakout with roguelike elements. Wield powerful balls, strategize against dynamic bricks, and explore unique mechanics in each playthrough. This strategic, arcade-style game redefines the classic, promising endless replayability and thrill.",
